{"id": "t047-003", "text": "Anika and Ryan are off to Japan for three weeks, leaving 9/2. Ryan has never done a long-haul flight and he's properly nervous, keeps reading about turbulence. Anika just wants Kyoto recommendations and someone to water the plants. Said I'd pop round the evening before to get the spare key.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anika", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ryan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Japan", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "three weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "9/2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ryan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anika", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the evening before", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t047-014", "text": "Zoe passed her driving test! Third time lucky. Remind me to send her something.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her something", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t047-015", "text": "Coffee with Erin. She's started at the hospital pharmacy, loves it but the commute is brutal. Her partner Hemi is on nights for the next month. They're thinking about moving closer in the spring.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Erin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "at the hospital pharmacy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "loves it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "commute is brutal", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hemi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "on nights", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the next month"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving closer", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t047-016", "text": "Pooja's little boy turns 5 on March 2nd. Dinosaurs, everything is dinosaurs. Party's the Saturday after, 2 till 4 at the soft play.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pooja", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "little boy", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns 5", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 2nd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Dinosaurs", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Party", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Saturday after, 2 till 4", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t047-018", "text": "Chris is running the Lisbon half on 3/22, his first one ever. He's been struggling with his knee and isn't sure he'll finish. Text him good luck the day before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chris", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Lisbon half", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3/22", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling with his knee", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text him good luck", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t047-021", "text": "Bethany and Ravi's housewarming is Saturday from 7. They finally got the flat in Leith. Ravi doesn't drink, so bring something fizzy for him as well as wine.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bethany", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ravi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "housewarming", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday from 7", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got the flat in Leith", "event_type": "move", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ravi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't drink", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bring something fizzy for him as well as wine", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "on", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t047-023", "text": "Mohammed and his wife are expecting their second in May. He's already worrying about flying to see her family in Amman with a newborn.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mohammed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in May", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "worrying about flying", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "r1"}]}
{"id": "t047-031", "text": "Irina says Henrik is moving to Oslo for work in January. He's nervous about the new job but excited. She's organising a leaving do for him on Dec 12 at 7, so keep that free. Lukas reckons it's his chance to finally learn proper Norwegian, he's already doing Duolingo every morning.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Irina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Henrik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Oslo", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving do", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Dec 12 at 7", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "keep that free", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lukas", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing Duolingo", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "every morning"}]}
{"id": "t047-035", "text": "Quick call with Kieran. He's in Dubai for work until Thursday then flies on to Sydney, landing Saturday at 5am. Already sounded jet-lagged.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kieran", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "in Dubai for work", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "until Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flies on to Sydney", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday at 5am", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "jet-lagged", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t047-036", "text": "Must post Zoe's present by Wednesday morning. Her birthday's Friday the 17th and the post is useless.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "post Zoe's present", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Wednesday morning", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday the 17th", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t047-037", "text": "Laura said her mum has been in and out of hospital and she's really struggling to juggle it with work. Don't push her about the trip. Maybe pop round next week with some food.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laura", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in and out of hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling to juggle it with work", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "trip", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pop round", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t047-038", "text": "Dinner with Chidi, Pooja and Ravi. Pooja's doing her yoga teacher training, finishes in June. Ravi's got an allotment now and won't stop talking about squash. Chidi is still looking for a flat and his landlord wants him out by the end of next month.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chidi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pooja", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ravi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pooja", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "yoga teacher training", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in June", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ravi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "allotment", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "squash", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chidi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "looking for a flat", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "landlord", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the end of next month", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t047-039", "text": "Video call Auntie Irina on Sunday at 2. It's her 70th on July 4th and she wants everyone on the call together.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Video call Auntie Irina", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Auntie Irina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday at 2", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "70th", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "July 4th", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t047-043", "text": "Luca and Caitlin met at Spanish class and now they're going to Seville together in October! Luca is terrified of flying so Caitlin booked the train via Paris. Took her three evenings to work out the connections. They want to have everyone round for paella when they're back.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caitlin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "met at Spanish class", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going to Seville", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in October", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified of flying", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caitlin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "have everyone round for paella", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "when they're back", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t047-044", "text": "Ring the travel agent Friday at 3pm about the Lisbon flights. Has to be done before the 9/30 deadline.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ring the travel agent", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "travel agent"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at 3pm", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Lisbon flights", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before the 9/30 deadline", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t047-048", "text": "Met Jakub's girlfriend Anika Morris at the barbecue. She's a vet, just back from six months in Chile. Jakub is clearly smitten.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jakub", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anika Morris", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "vet", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back from six months in Chile", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jakub", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "smitten", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t047-049", "text": "Katarzyna's back from Poland and her gran is doing much better. Remind me to ask her for the photos and whether she still wants to do Krakow on 5/14 next year.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Katarzyna", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back from Poland", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "gran", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her for the photos and whether she still wants to do Krakow", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "do Krakow", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "5/14 next year", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t047-050", "text": "Dev's wedding in Jaipur is Dec 2nd to 4th. Flights are crazy. I'm flying out on the 29th, Ravi's coming on the 1st, and Dev's cousin Pooja is sorting the hotel block for everyone. Dev's mum wants us all in proper outfits for the sangeet, so a tailor trip is needed once I land.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dev", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding in Jaipur", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Dec 2nd to 4th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 29th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ravi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 1st", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dev", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cousin", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pooja", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dev", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "sangeet", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "tailor trip", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "once I land", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t047-056", "text": "Packing for Canada: adapters, warm coat, Laura's book to give back. Taxi booked for 4:15am Monday.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Canada", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "adapters", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "warm coat", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Laura's book to give back", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laura", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "4:15am Monday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t047-059", "text": "Pooja and Dev fly back from Goa tonight, landing 7:25 tomorrow morning. I'm doing the airport run so leave by 6.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pooja", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dev", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fly back from Goa", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "7:25 tomorrow morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "leave", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "by 6", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t047-060", "text": "Long catch-up with Ryan and Zoe at the pub. Zoe has accepted a place on a midwifery course starting in January and is moving back to Leeds for it, which means selling the flat in a hurry. Ryan's band has a gig at the Brudenell on 12/6 at 8 and he wants a big crowd. He also mentioned his mum's 60th is coming up in the new year, she's into gardening and gin. I should get the gig tickets this week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ryan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "accepted a place", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "midwifery course", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving back to Leeds", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "selling the flat", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ryan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gig at the Brudenell", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "12/6 at 8", "anchor": "e5"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e6", "type": "EVENT", "text": "60th", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e6"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "gardening", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "gin", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get the gig tickets", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e5"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
